The full agent context for this repository lives in **[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)**
at the repo root. Read it before making changes.

It covers what AEGIS is, the invariants that must not be broken (credential
custody, catalog-bound payees, fail closed, control/data plane separation, no
LLM in the enforcement path), the module map, how to run and test, and the
current real-vs-simulated state.

`CLAUDE.md` is a byte-identical copy of `AGENTS.md`. Edit `AGENTS.md` and run
`python scripts/sync_agent_docs.py`; CI fails if they drift.
